    ts:originClusterId "6392808b6d8e4eb2" ;
    ts:passage "At Composio, we are building infrastructure that allows agents to communicate with the tools you use for work including Github, Gmail, Notion, Salesforce, etc. We are a small team of engineers wrangling problems from context to search, that help us provide the most capable bridge between your agents and your tools. We raised a $25M Series A from Lightspeed https://lsvp.com/stories/investing-in-composio-building-the-backbone-of-ai-agent-intelligence/ with some incredible angels like Guillermo Rauch (CEO of Vercel), Dharmesh Shah (CTO of Hubspot), Gokul Rajaram. Beginning of this year we 3x our ARR, our customers range from your friends in the YC batch to Wabi, Glean, Zoom and many more. WHAT YOU'LL DO? - tell us the job you would be exceptional at and why Composio should create space for it - show us the work - products shipped, companies started, research, writing, open source, workflows, or anything else with real signal - explain what you would own in your first 30 days and what would be measurably better because you joined - use agents and Composio to make yourself faster, then teach the rest of us what worked - be clear about the parts of the company you want to push on: product, engineering, research, GTM, operations, talent, or something we have not named yet \"MUST HAVES\" if you are very good, nothing is a must per-se - exceptional at something - we should be able to tell what you are unusually good at from the way you apply - ai native - you use agents every day and have opinions about what they can and cannot do - taste - you have finger feel for quality in your domain - owner - you can turn ambiguity into shipped work without waiting for a perfect role definition - typist - you can write clearly enough that we understand how you think - human - you build trust and admit what you do not know OPTIONAL - started a company or built a large side project - contributed to open source or a public technical community - built something with language models that changed how you work - can point to a body of work that makes the role obvious HOW TO APPLY Apply with the role you want, what makes you exceptional, and the first thing you would build or fix at Composio." ;
