<https://example.org/trendscout/source-record/job-board/deepset/05b807d2-f9bc-48a1-a830-8cafee07ed5d/614ef5ae42276450> a ts:SourceRecord ;
    ts:about <https://example.org/trendscout/startup/deepset> ;
    ts:collectorVersion "cohort-jobs/1.0" ;
    ts:contentHash "3df526280310856e1d2b370a5c7f8fe635f96610280ebbf6abe8716108b01cf4" ;
    ts:documents <https://example.org/trendscout/job-posting/ashby/deepset/05b807d2-f9bc-48a1-a830-8cafee07ed5d> ;
    ts:eventAt "2026-11-21T08:03:10+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    ts:memberOfOrigin <https://example.org/trendscout/origin/fd97f36ae8a1a26c> ;
    ts:observedAt "2026-11-21T08:03:10+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    ts:originClusterId "fd97f36ae8a1a26c" ;
    ts:passage "TL;DR You'll own the EU institutional market end to end. It is a hybrid hunter/farmer role winning new institutional logos (ECB, Parliament, Council, EU agencies) while expanding our footprint inside the European Commission, where deepset already powers the AI@EC platform. Sovereign AI has moved from policy ambition to procurement reality, and the person who builds this franchise now will own one of the most defensible books of business in European enterprise AI. This is a field role, not pipeline-from-a-desk: you'll be deepset's face in Brussels, in the rooms where procurement decisions are shaped long before a tender is published. WHY DEEPSET At deepset, we’re on a mission to make custom AI solutions accessible to every organization. With Haystack, thousands of developers build advanced LLM applications every day, while our enterprise-ready AI Platform helps companies turn large language models into business value. We’re remote-first, flexible, and built on a culture of trust and ownership. You’ll collaborate with top-tier tech talent, tackle meaningful challenges, and help transform complex AI into solutions that are simple, powerful, and ready for the real world. WHAT YOU WILL DO - Build and convert a pipeline of new institutional logos, positioning deepset in the pre-tender phase to shape requirements rather than respond to them - Navigate EU procurement — framework contracts, CPV-coded tenders, cascading lots — and develop partner and integrator relationships for consortium bids - Grow existing institutional accounts, most notably the European Commission, turning single deployments into institution-wide standards - Build deepset's Brussels presence through speaking slots, roundtables, executive dinners, and the institutional AI and digital-sovereignty event circuit - Cultivate a network across CIO/CTO offices, innovation labs, policy units, and procurement functions - Own account plans, stakeholder maps, and multi-year territory strategy, feeding market and policy intelligence back into the business WHAT YOU BRING TO THE TEAM - A track record of selling complex software into EU institutions specifically — you've navigated EU public procurement, framework contracts, and tenders, and closed institutional business - An existing network within the EU institutional ecosystem — you know how decisions get made and who makes them - Proven results in both motions: hunting new logos and growing installed accounts - Comfort with long, multi-stakeholder sales cycles (12–24 months) balanced against in-year expansion revenue - Enough technical fluency to credibly discuss AI platforms, deployment models (SaaS vs. on-premise vs. sovereign cloud), and data governance - Fluent English; based in Brussels or committed to relocating — this role does not work remotely NICE TO HAVE - French highly valuable; German a plus - AI fluency: you've built your own AI tooling to drive sales efficacy — pitching, research, or message positioning BENEFITS - Remote-first setup with flexible hours & tech of your choice - 30 days vacation + extra days for family sick leave - Competitive salary & stock options for every team member - Monthly sports & mental health support allowance with Oliva - Annual learning & development budget - Monthly team socials & in-person meetups - Dog-friendly Berlin HQ About us Founded in 2018, deepset builds open and enterprise-grade tools that help teams build AI with purpose. From Haystack, our open-source framework, to the Haystack Enterprise Platform, we give developers and organizations the building blocks to solve complex, high impact challenges with AI with full control, transparency, and sovereignty. Backed by GV and Balderton, we’re growing the world’s production AI community and customer base solving challenges too critical to get wrong. ‍Visit us to learn more: deepset Website https://www.deepset.ai/ | Haystack Website https://haystack.deepset.ai/ | GitHub https://github.com/deepset-ai/haystack| Linkedin https://www.linkedin.com/company/deepset-ai | X deepset (Twitter) https://twitter.com/deepset_ai | X haystack (Twitter) https://x.com/haystack_ai" ;
    ts:publishedAt "2026-08-25T14:51:48+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    ts:publishedBy <https://example.org/trendscout/publisher/deepset> ;
    ts:recordId "job-board:deepset:05b807d2-f9bc-48a1-a830-8cafee07ed5d:614ef5ae42276450" ;
    ts:sourceType "job" ;
    ts:sourceUrl "https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/deepsetai"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    ts:supports <https://example.org/trendscout/claim/bbc1107a9fe4abffa5f2> ;
    ts:title "Account Executive (EU Institutions)" .

<https://example.org/trendscout/source-record/job-board/deepset/0f272bd8-6d4a-4986-ae00-8f78ac34a9ff/614ef5ae42276450> a ts:SourceRecord ;
    ts:about <https://example.org/trendscout/startup/deepset> ;
    ts:collectorVersion "cohort-jobs/1.0" ;
    ts:contentHash "5900408f6ae0d2e36ca80b9abfa34f5c67a58fc0ee70f4b1a4169636a6137797" ;
    ts:documents <https://example.org/trendscout/job-posting/ashby/deepset/0f272bd8-6d4a-4986-ae00-8f78ac34a9ff> ;
    ts:eventAt "2026-11-21T08:03:10+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    ts:memberOfOrigin <https://example.org/trendscout/origin/fd97f36ae8a1a26c> ;
    ts:observedAt "2026-11-21T08:03:10+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    ts:originClusterId "fd97f36ae8a1a26c" ;
    ts:passage "TL;DR We’re hiring a Manager to lead our Forward Deployed Engineering (FDE) team in Customer Engineering. You build a healthy, high-trust team and make sure it delivers deepset’s AI Platform into enterprise and public sector production environments, on target and on quality. You came up close to the work and still go deep when it matters. WHY DEEPSET At deepset, we’re on a mission to make custom AI solutions accessible to every organization. With Haystack, thousands of developers build advanced LLM applications every day, while our enterprise-ready AI Platform helps companies turn large language models into business value. We’re remote-first, flexible, and built on a culture of trust and ownership. You’ll collaborate with top-tier tech talent, tackle meaningful challenges, and help transform complex AI into solutions that are simple, powerful, and ready for the real world. WHAT YOU WILL DO Lead and Develop the Team - Own team health and culture across the four FDE profiles (Advisory, Builder, Operating, Support): a safe space where hard questions are welcome and engineers share patterns instead of working in silos. - Run strong 1:1s and career conversations so every FDE knows where they stand and how to grow. - Build the hiring and onboarding pipeline for a remote-first, async-heavy team. - Clear blockers fast, and escalate the ones you can’t resolve before they become delivery risks. Run the Delivery Engine - Staff the right FDE profile to the right engagement and deliver against your team’s utilization targets, protecting against both burnout and idle capacity. - Hold the technical bar: review architecture and solution decisions across RAG pipelines, retrieval quality, deployment topology, and production operations. - Deliver engagements on scope and on plan, follow our delivery processes, and own resolution of customer escalations. Collaborate Across the Organization - Partner with the Delivery Lead and Value Engineers on scope, feasibility, and staffing, with clear ownership at each handoff. - Feed field insight to Product and Engineering, and build reusable patterns that reduce custom work. WHAT YOU BRING TO THE TEAM - Experience leading customer-facing engineering, professional services, or delivery teams in enterprise software, AI, or infrastructure. - Strong coaching instincts: you develop engineers and build high-trust teams. - Technical depth to hold the bar: RAG (retrieval, embeddings, re-ranking, evaluation), cloud and self-hosted deployments, model optimization, APIs, integrations, and IAM/security fundamentals. - Commercial awareness: you understand how scope, staffing, and execution affect utilization, revenue, and margin. - Clear, written and verbal communication with technical and executive audiences, and comfort with ambiguity in a remote-first setup. NICE TO HAVE - Experience running services or delivery inside a SaaS or platform company navigating the move to enterprise and self-hosted deployments. - Experience with OKR frameworks and squad-based delivery organizations. - Familiarity with agent-based systems, LLM platforms, and AI-native engineering tooling- BENEFITS - Remote-first setup with flexible hours & tech of your choice - 30 days vacation + extra days for family sick leave - Competitive salary & stock options for every team member - Monthly sports & mental health support allowance with Oliva - Annual learning & development budget - Monthly team socials & in-person meetups - Dog-friendly Berlin HQ About us Founded in 2018, deepset builds open and enterprise-grade tools that help teams build AI with purpose. From Haystack, our open-source framework, to the Haystack Enterprise Platform, we give developers and organizations the building blocks to solve complex, high impact challenges with AI with full control, transparency, and sovereignty. Backed by GV and Balderton, we’re growing the world’s production AI community and customer base solving challenges too critical to get wrong. ‍Visit us to learn more: deepset Website https://www.deepset.ai/ | Haystack Website https://haystack.deepset.ai/ | GitHub https://github.com/deepset-ai/haystack| Linkedin https://www.linkedin.com/company/deepset-ai | X deepset (Twitter) https://twitter.com/deepset_ai | X haystack (Twitter) https://x.com/haystack_ai" ;
    ts:publishedAt "2026-10-22T12:59:03+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    ts:publishedBy <https://example.org/trendscout/publisher/deepset> ;
    ts:recordId "job-board:deepset:0f272bd8-6d4a-4986-ae00-8f78ac34a9ff:614ef5ae42276450" ;
    ts:sourceType "job" ;
    ts:sourceUrl "https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/deepsetai"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    ts:supports <https://example.org/trendscout/claim/d887fc30c132c8a4c728> ;
    ts:title "Forward Deployed Engineering Manager" .

<https://example.org/trendscout/source-record/job-board/deepset/18e3167e-7727-43df-9166-06b185421ded/614ef5ae42276450> a ts:SourceRecord ;
    ts:about <https://example.org/trendscout/startup/deepset> ;
    ts:collectorVersion "cohort-jobs/1.0" ;
    ts:contentHash "2839012d9275a63d538a5eb0de3759088e37f5fb2e86c5a652aac8d073af27a0" ;
    ts:documents <https://example.org/trendscout/job-posting/ashby/deepset/18e3167e-7727-43df-9166-06b185421ded> ;
    ts:eventAt "2026-11-21T08:03:10+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
